<x-public-layout title="Terms of use">
    <h1>DahonMD terms of use</h1>
    <p>Effective date: October 7, 2026</p>
    <p>DahonMD provides banana-leaf screening and an optional agriculturist review. An AI result is a screening result, not a confirmed diagnosis. Consult a local agriculture professional before making treatment decisions.</p>
    <p>You can scan on your phone without an account. If you create an account, your saved scans and photos can be synchronized to the server for history and any review you request. Keep your account credentials private and submit only photos you have permission to use.</p>
    <p>By accepting these account terms in the current signup form, you also agree that future account scan photos may enter a research candidate queue after an agriculturist reviews them. A second staff member must approve a photo before it is kept as a private research copy. An approved copy may remain after its scan is deleted. You can turn off future sharing and withdraw current consent in your account settings. Existing accounts keep their current research preference.</p>
    <p>Read the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> for data handling, deletion and contact information.</p>
</x-public-layout>
